WEBVTT

NOTE storyboard drift-review-queue: 5 steps and 2 cards

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
From a finding to a decision

2
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:09.637
The review queue: every gap between the documentation and the network, with the open count on top.

3
00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:16.640
Findings are grouped by kind, and each group shows how many are open.

4
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:23.718
Each finding says why it was flagged. This one: a link the switches report over LLDP or CDP, with no cable on record.

5
00:00:23.718 --> 00:00:31.956
On the topology it is a ghost link: seen on the wire, missing from the record.

6
00:00:31.956 --> 00:00:38.784
Back in the queue, the reviewer decides: document the link, or dismiss the finding.

7
00:00:38.784 --> 00:00:41.338
Every gap between the documentation and the network, in one queue. A person decides.
